
Create a basic Django website called Student Management System.

Requirements
Create a Django project named:
student_project
Create an app named:
students
Configure project and app URLs properly.
Create pages:
Home page (/)
Students page (/students/)
Use:
Templates
Static files (CSS)
Template inheritance (base.html)
Create the following templates:
base.html
home.html
students.html
Add a CSS file and connect it using {% load static %}.
Create a model named Student with fields:
name → CharField
age → IntegerField
email → EmailField
course → CharField
joined_date → DateField
Register the model in admin.
Run migrations and add at least 5 student records.
Create views to:
Show homepage
